# feralos evolution-data-server-user-dinit: D-Bus activation target for
# org.gnome.evolution.dataserver.Sources5 (ADR-010). Transitional: drop when the
# package (or dbus-broker ephemeral services) ships this unit itself.
type = process
command = /usr/libexec/evolution-source-registry
smooth-recovery = true
restart = false
load-options = sub-vars
logfile = $HOME/.local/share/dinit/org.gnome.evolution.dataserver.Sources5.log
depends-on = dbus.user
